id: all-or-nothing
name: All or Nothing
kind: signature
side: disadvantages
tpCost: -5
requirement: N/A
description: >
  Give it your all! This Signature Technique draws out all of your power.
text: >
  You must make the highest Ki Wager possible for this Signature Technique. If,
  after using this Signature Technique, your Capacity is not 0 - set your
  Capacity to 0.

---

# No script, for the same reason Full Wager has none: this one sets the *floor* of
# the Ki Wager to whatever its ceiling is, which is a thing about the question and
# not about the character.
#
# The second half - emptying what is left of your Capacity afterwards - is not built.
# Capacity is spent rather than set, and there is no way yet for an effect to say
# "whatever is left of this, it is gone". That is worth having on its own and is not
# worth faking here: half of this Disadvantage would be a Disadvantage that costs
# you nothing.
